<# Build exists only when tests are split out of the build job, and it holds
   both "Conan Build" (Linux) and "Conan Build - Windows". Gate on either
   platform: dropping it when only Linux is off leaves the Windows job
   declaring a stage that stages: omits, which GitLab rejects outright. #>
<% if ci_split_tests and (ci_linux or ci_windows) %>
  - Build
<% endif %>
  - Test
<% if ci_linux %>
